## 3. KPIs and Success Metrics

### 3.1 Primary Success Metrics

Based on [MLOPs@CoreML Long Term Plan](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202089f42605e1d342df8e8011fe153d216f/pages/5783505356), [ML Craft Excellence Signals](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~750924760/pages/5642415635), and [ML Lens FY26 H1 KRs](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5597640811):

| **Metric** | **Target** | **Measurement** |
|-----------|-----------|----------------|
| **Time-to-Production** | Decrease from months → weeks | From experiment start to production serving |
| **Model Reliability (Uptime)** | > 99.5% for online services | Monitored via ML Lens / SignalFx |
| **Pipeline Failure Run Rate** | < 1% for offline pipelines | Success/failure ratio of scheduled runs |
| **Experiment Velocity** | ≥ X experiments completed per week | MLflow experiment registry count |
| **Experimentation Cycle Time** | 30% reduction (per MLP OKR) | Time from hypothesis to production A/B result |
| **Model Accuracy** | Meet per-model targets (precision, recall, F1, NDCG@K) | Offline eval + online A/B metrics |
| **Drift Incidents** | Measurable reduction in drift-caused degradation | Incidents tagged with drift root cause |

### 3.2 AI Employee-Specific KPIs

Per [AIF (PAI) L3-O1-KR1: AI Employee](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/aifun/pages/6978208776):

| **KR Dimension** | **0.5 (Below Target)** | **0.7 (On Track)** | **1.0 (Best Case)** |
|-----------------|----------------------|-------------------|---------------------|
| **MLE Agent Pipeline Functions** | Role playbook defined; deployed in sandbox with ≥1 team testing | Live with ≥1 team; autonomously executes ≥1 real pipeline function (drift alerting, experiment tracking, retraining trigger); ≥X tasks/week | ≥2 teams; owns ≥X pipeline tasks/week end-to-end; Time-to-Delegation ≤X weeks |
| **MLE Agent Quality Impact** | E2E auto-finetuning on par with baseline | Precision > 80%, Recall > 50%, Latency on par | + P50 Latency reduce by 100ms |
| **Autonomous Operation** | Agent iterates pipeline for up to 12hrs | Out-performs production baseline on blind test set | Sustained autonomous improvement with minimal human intervention |

### 3.3 Operational Health Metrics

| **Category** | **Metrics** | **Source** |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|
| **Online Operational** | Latency (P50/P90/P99), Throughput, Availability, Timeout rate | SignalFx / MSP |
| **Offline Performance** | Precision@K, Recall@K, NDCG, MAP@K, MRR, Hit Rate@K | MLflow / Databricks |
| **Business Metrics** | Click-through rate, Resolution rate, Acceptance rate, Dwell time | Statsig / Amplitude |
| **Data Quality** | Volume change%, Distribution shift (PSI/KS), Null rate changes | ML Lens |
| **Cost Efficiency** | Training cost per experiment, Inference cost per 1K predictions, GPU utilization | Cloud billing + SignalFx |
| **Documentation** | % of models with complete documentation, Experiment analysis docs generated | Confluence audit |

### 3.4 The North Star: Time-to-Delegation

Per [AI Employee Strategy](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202027e1af5d30e94112880666ee62f9277a/pages/6742955831): **How quickly does a team trust their digital MLE to handle a complex task autonomously?** This measures not just adoption, but the quality of the trust model.

